            "review_text": "Noah\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam66 contributions\n0\nThe first Yoshinoya in Vietnam\nAug 2023 • Family\nVery interesting. I love how they present my food with a little flame under the mini claypot. Fresh salad, good taste, extremely big potion for 1 person.\nEverything are perfect, except for just one thing that made me don't wanna comback ever again. It's the guardian man who kept whinning hard on me to have some parking fee, even when I showed him that my motobike ticket already clearly included the \"FREE PARKING\" service ???\nI felt bad, very very bad. You'll losing customer after all just because of this little issue.\nRead more\nWritten October 5, 2023",
